  "docTitle": "SDE Prep Dojo - Complete SDE-1 & SDE-2 Interview Prep",
  "description": "Complete SDE-1 and SDE-2 interview preparation: system design (HLD) with patterns and 75 real designs, DevOps and infra (Docker, Kubernetes, Kafka, a real pipeline), an interview hub with real recent questions, low-level design (OOP, patterns, machine coding), and a coding track coming soon - from 1st grade to FAANG offer.",
