    "html": "\r\n        <div>\r\n          <span class=\"hero-eyebrow\">🥋 SDE Prep Dojo</span>\r\n          <h1>From 1st grade<br>to <span class=\"grad\">FAANG offer</span></h1>\r\n          <p class=\"lead\">Complete SDE-1 and SDE-2 interview prep in one place: system design (HLD) with reusable patterns and 75 real designs, the DevOps and infra every backend engineer gets asked about (Docker, Kubernetes, Kafka, a real pipeline), low-level design (OOP, SOLID, design patterns, UML, concurrency and 45 machine-coding case studies with running Java, Python and C++), and an interview hub full of real, recently asked questions. A coding / DSA track is on the way. Every topic starts with a kid-simple story and climbs, one level at a time, to the answers that win the offer.</p>\r\n          <div class=\"hero-actions\">\r\n            <a class=\"btn primary big\" href=\"{{BASE}}hld/hld-index\">Start system design →</a>\r\n            <a class=\"btn big\" href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-start-index\">Start LLD</a>\r\n            <a class=\"btn big\" href=\"{{BASE}}devops/docker-01\">DevOps Level 1</a>\r\n            <a class=\"btn big\" href=\"{{BASE}}interview/study-plan\">8-week study plan</a>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"hero-tech\">\r\n            <span class=\"chip accent\">🏗️ HLD</span>\r\n            <span class=\"chip docker\">🐳 Docker</span>\r\n            <span class=\"chip k8s\">☸️ Kubernetes</span>\r\n            <span class=\"chip kafka\">📨 Kafka</span>\r\n            <span class=\"chip ok\">🛠️ Pipeline</span>\r\n            <span class=\"chip warn\">🎯 Interviews</span>\r\n            <span class=\"chip accent\">🧠 LLD</span>\r\n            <span class=\"chip\">💻 Coding / DSA (soon)</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <figure class=\"hero-art diagram bare\">\r\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 610 410\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animated flow: containers run inside pods, pods write events to a Kafka topic with three partitions, a consumer group reads them\">\r\n            <defs><marker id=\"arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\"/></marker></defs>\r\n\r\n            <!-- pods holding containers -->\r\n            <rect class=\"zone k8s\" x=\"10\" y=\"70\" width=\"170\" height=\"112\"/>\r\n            <text class=\"zone-label\" x=\"24\" y=\"91\">☸ Pod</text>\r\n            <rect class=\"box docker\" x=\"28\" y=\"102\" width=\"134\" height=\"56\"/>\r\n            <text class=\"label\" x=\"95\" y=\"124\">🐳 order-svc</text>\r\n            <text class=\"label small\" x=\"95\" y=\"145\">container</text>\r\n\r\n            <rect class=\"zone k8s\" x=\"10\" y=\"232\" width=\"170\" height=\"112\"/>\r\n            <text class=\"zone-label\" x=\"24\" y=\"253\">☸ Pod</text>\r\n            <rect class=\"box docker\" x=\"28\" y=\"264\" width=\"134\" height=\"56\"/>\r\n            <text class=\"label\" x=\"95\" y=\"286\">🐳 order-svc</text>\r\n            <text class=\"label small\" x=\"95\" y=\"307\">container</text>\r\n\r\n            <!-- kafka topic -->\r\n            <rect class=\"zone kafka\" x=\"214\" y=\"40\" width=\"204\" height=\"326\"/>\r\n            <text class=\"zone-label\" x=\"228\" y=\"62\">📨 topic: orders</text>\r\n            <g>\r\n              <text class=\"label small start\" x=\"252\" y=\"90\">P0</text>\r\n              <rect class=\"cell filled\" x=\"252\" y=\"101\" width=\"24\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\"/>\r\n              <rect class=\"cell filled\" x=\"280\" y=\"101\" width=\"24\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\"/>\r\n              <rect class=\"cell filled\" x=\"308\" y=\"101\" width=\"24\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\"/>\r\n              <rect class=\"cell filled\" x=\"336\" y=\"101\" width=\"24\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\"/>\r\n              <rect class=\"cell\" x=\"364\" y=\"101\" width=\"24\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0.25;1;0.25\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></rect>\r\n            </g>\r\n            <g>\r\n              <text class=\"label small start\" x=\"252\" y=\"175\">P1</text>\r\n              <rect class=\"cell filled\" x=\"252\" y=\"186\" width=\"24\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\"/>\r\n              <rect class=\"cell filled\" x=\"280\" y=\"186\" width=\"24\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\"/>\r\n              <rect class=\"cell filled\" x=\"308\" y=\"186\" width=\"24\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\"/>\r\n              <rect class=\"cell\" x=\"336\" y=\"186\" width=\"24\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0.25;1;0.25\" dur=\"3s\" begin=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></rect>\r\n            </g>\r\n            <g>\r\n              <text class=\"label small start\" x=\"252\" y=\"260\">P2</text>\r\n              <rect class=\"cell filled\" x=\"252\" y=\"271\" width=\"24\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\"/>\r\n              <rect class=\"cell filled\" x=\"280\" y=\"271\" width=\"24\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\"/>\r\n              <rect class=\"cell filled\" x=\"308\" y=\"271\" width=\"24\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\"/>\r\n              <rect class=\"cell filled\" x=\"336\" y=\"271\" width=\"24\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\"/>\r\n              <rect class=\"cell\" x=\"364\" y=\"271\" width=\"24\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0.25;1;0.25\" dur=\"3s\" begin=\"1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></rect>\r\n            </g>\r\n            <text class=\"label small\" x=\"316\" y=\"345\">append-only log</text>\r\n\r\n            <!-- consumer group -->\r\n            <rect class=\"zone\" x=\"446\" y=\"60\" width=\"156\" height=\"290\"/>\r\n            <text class=\"zone-label\" x=\"458\" y=\"82\">consumer group</text>\r\n            <rect class=\"box svc\" x=\"460\" y=\"92\" width=\"128\" height=\"52\"/>\r\n            <text class=\"label\" x=\"524\" y=\"118\">billing-1</text>\r\n            <rect class=\"box svc\" x=\"460\" y=\"177\" width=\"128\" height=\"52\"/>\r\n            <text c